WEBVTT

00:05:29.450 --> 00:05:31.410
He knew who had killed his sister.

00:05:32.203 --> 00:05:34.497
And he ran up to his room to get a gun.

00:05:37.083 --> 00:05:38.709
Let me pause there for a sec.

00:05:39.126 --> 00:05:41.253
Do you remember
what I told you a minute ago,

00:05:41.253 --> 00:05:43.881
about how violence
can lead to more violence?

00:05:44.632 --> 00:05:46.133
That could have been Walter.

00:05:47.176 --> 00:05:48.302
But it wasn't.

00:05:49.095 --> 00:05:52.932
Because he told me that when
he pictured his mentor, Eluvia,

00:05:52.973 --> 00:05:58.854
and the little glee club kids finding out
that their role model had killed someone,

00:05:58.854 --> 00:06:00.272
he put the gun down.